-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- the open line: (M_n)_cd routed into a held index
-- The hop's gravitational factor leaves the two indices of M_n = h_n √V h_n^{-1} at v open: d contracts with the
-- index the vertex already holds open as its last leg (the start of H_p, attached first), c becomes the new open leg.
-- One branch: h_n^{-1} attached (E, its index a appended), a contracted with the held leg (ε, chem/electric.cub's
-- contraction of the last two legs), the vertex then gauge-invariant with n and p changed, √V there (left out here,
-- at √V → 1), h_n attached by emission (F̃, its index b appended): the vertex again holds one open leg.
open-branch : Nat → Bool → List Nat → List SQ → List SQ
open-branch n sn dsP v = map-apply (if sn then scaled-entry ((exp-at n (exp-init (exp-init (ds-plus n dsP))) , suc (exp-at n (exp-init (exp-init (ds-plus n dsP))))) , (zero , suc zero)) (eminus-entry n (exp-init (exp-init (ds-plus n dsP)))) else scaled-entry (sq-neg sq-one) (eplus-entry n (exp-init (exp-init (ds-minus n dsP)))))
    (mons0 dsP)
    (mons0 (exp-init (exp-init (if sn then ds-plus n dsP else ds-minus n dsP))))
    (map-apply contr-entry (mons0 (exp-init (exp-init (if sn then ds-plus n dsP else ds-minus n dsP)))) (mons0 (if sn then ds-plus n dsP else ds-minus n dsP))
      (map-apply (if sn then eplus-entry n dsP else eminus-entry n dsP) (mons0 (if sn then ds-plus n dsP else ds-minus n dsP)) (mons0 dsP) v))
